<div class="pj">
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 753);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 80)">
    <div class="pj-img" style="--x:0;--y:0;--w:1320;--h:753"><img src="/img/mol1/01.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pj-text" style="--x:441;--w:804;margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 101)">
    <p>Rural rehabilitation and change of use. This study looks closely at an existing rural property near Madrid, including its land, its buildings and the way it sits in the landscape, to understand what it could become. The feasibility study and the full planning process for a change of use on rural land lay the groundwork for a future hotel, one that grows from what is already there rather than replacing it.</p>
